  "outcome_detail": "Full bench of the Constitutional Court (Munalula PCC; Shilimi DPCC; Mulonda, Mulenga, Chisunka, Mwandenga and Mulife JJC) discharged the single-Judge order that had stayed criminal proceedings against the Petitioner (Milingo Lungu) in the Subordinate Courts. The Court made no order for costs. Outcome coded `set-aside` because the operative order vacated (discharged) the prior single-Judge stay order.",
